Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:06.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}46{\fs68}岁的大威廉姆斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:08.75,TL,,0,0,0,,单打已经连输{\fs78}15{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.75,0:00:10.72,TL,,0,0,0,,她又拿着外卡来到广州
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.71,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么还在打？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:16.56,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿过{\fs78}7{\fs68}个大满贯单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:17.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}个在温网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.59,0:00:18.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}枚奥运金牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:21.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2002{\fs68}年登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:34.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match. Miss Williams, two sets to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束 威廉姆斯{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:38.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six-one, three-six, six-love.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:44.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ah, the dance we saw last year, with a nice smile from the loser.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是去年那段舞 输家也笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:46.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年{\fs78}3{\fs68}月之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.10,0:00:47.91,TL,,0,0,0,,她做了子宫肌瘤手术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:49.89,TL,,0,0,0,,离开赛场{\fs78}16{\fs68}个月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:51.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:53.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她在华盛顿复出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.63,0:00:58.07,TL,,0,0,0,,赛前有记者问 {\fs78}45{\fs68}岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:01:00.56,TL,,0,0,0,,天这么热 为什么还要打？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:03.60,TL,,0,0,0,,她笑着反问 为什么不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:15.05,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Venus Williams, back with a bang.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N大威廉姆斯 强势回归
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:30.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And becomes the oldest WTA tour winner since 2004, at the age of 45.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她成了{\fs78}2004{\fs68}年来最年长的胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:42.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the smile tells you everything you need to know. She loves this sport.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N笑容说明一切 她热爱这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:43.95,TL,,0,0,0,,她说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.95,0:01:47.04,TL,,0,0,0,,想念的是比赛本身的乐趣和挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:50.24,TL,,0,0,0,,很多时候 要战胜的是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:53.98,TL,,0,0,0,,可那场之后 她的单打再没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.73,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年输了{\fs78}3{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.73,0:01:58.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}年又输了{\fs78}12{\fs68}场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.79,TL,,0,0,0,,有两场 只差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.43,TL,,0,0,0,,一月澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:06.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}45{\fs68}岁的她是正赛年纪最大的女选手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.97,0:02:08.44,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮对达尼洛维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:10.57,TL,,0,0,0,,她打进了决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:15.75,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 她{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:18.36,TL,,0,0,0,,达尼洛维奇连赢了{\fs78}6{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:50.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}This is an incredible comeback from Olga Danilovic.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N达尼洛维奇不可思议的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:53.24,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月美网首轮 对手是肯宁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:55.39,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘她{\fs78}7{\fs68}次拿到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:58.90,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七里{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先 又连丢了六分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:04.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a shot to hit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍太难打了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.33,0:03:12.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 打成了{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:22.97,TL,,0,0,0,,这一年 小威也回来陪她打双打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:24.48,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提和美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:26.20,TL,,0,0,0,,两场都输在抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:29.88,TL,,0,0,0,,美网那场 抢十里她们{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:34.13,TL,,0,0,0,,一年多里 美网 澳网 美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:36.10,TL,,0,0,0,,她都是拿外卡进的正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:38.46,TL,,0,0,0,,今年的印第安维尔斯 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.46,0:03:41.50,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里和辛辛那提 也是外卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.84,TL,,0,0,0,,有人说该把机会留给年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:47.07,TL,,0,0,0,,也有人说 球迷就是来看传奇的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:53.50,TL,,0,0,0,,美网输球后 被问到未来的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:56.98,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 我不觉得我必须去想这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:01.22,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年后第一次来亚洲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.60,TL,,0,0,0,,这趟也是她和丈夫的蜜月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:06.56,TL,,0,0,0,,她戴着在长隆买的帽子开发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.63,TL,,0,0,0,,双打首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:11.03,TL,,0,0,0,,她和曾丽美{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:16.87,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 没有其他球员享受早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.87,0:04:18.03,TL,,0,0,0,,只有我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:21.06,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球很有趣 但健康最重要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:24.09,TL,,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道明年要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.73,0:04:25.67,TL,,0,0,0,,单打首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:28.60,TL,,0,0,0,,她的对手是{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的{\fs78}4{\fs68}号种子塔格尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:30.63,TL,,0,0,0,,比她小{\fs78}28{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:35.74,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}46{\fs68}岁 还在输 也还在打
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.35,TL,,0,0,0,,你觉得 她该把外卡让给年轻人吗？
